        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gravel, unspecified, at mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gravel, unspecified, at mine
Mix of round and crushed gravel, allocation based on production of 4 swiss gravel plants: 79% round gravel and 21% crushed gravel;
Synonyms: Kies, Zuschlagstoff, gravel, aggregate; 
UUID: d351b306-a280-3d79-8f47-848dc4c4fe5d
includes the whole manufacturing process, internal processes (transport, etc.) and infrastructure. No administration is included. Recultivation is taken into account.
Location: For some exchanges RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: typical technology for Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 24500000 t/a
Sampling: Measured data of four Swiss plants 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d351b306-a280-3d79-8f47-848dc4c4fe5d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
